{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0454_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e9b82e25268a9efc24b5d085096747e8f934247bbfb72b4b5d46d75980e779cb", "ja": "（のり子と桃子が主演の、西洋を舞台とした映画の\n撮影日。ふたりの演技は現場でも大絶賛だった）", "zh": "（今天是诺莉子和桃子主演的西部电影的拍摄日。两人的演技在现场也受到了极高的赞誉。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0454_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "727dae14c79f69893fbf24ada3038cf409b2da1635e703f4f84c2278eaa7c8c3", "ja": "お疲れさま！　今日すっごい調子よかったよ！\n{$P$}は見ててどうだった？", "zh": "辛苦啦！今天状态特别好！\n{$P$}，你看着感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0454_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f406e3cb47d6153466a031169a2582f80d30d9ff687f17ce25ee09296dae3ace", "ja": "お疲れさま。うん、見ててすごく安心感があると\n思ってたよ。演技もすごく光ってたな。", "zh": "辛苦了。嗯，看着你的表现，我觉得特别放心。你的演技也非常出色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0454_1003_049mom", "source_sha256": "ba7f9bb06d8a1efe7d69c8f89672c6d82de1077437374603c2e140f2ad2e1edc", "ja": "桃子もそう思う。特にのり子さんのテーブルマナーは\n本当の貴婦人みたいですごく綺麗だったな。", "zh": "桃子也这么觉得。尤其是纪子小姐的餐桌礼仪，像真正的贵妇人一样，优雅极了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0454_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "3c3451837000a0464bdcb88f90e0f8858c384c94ec99ccf0f67ae087deb52b14", "ja": "ホント！？　よかった～！\n練習した成果、ちゃんと出せたみたいだね！", "zh": "真的吗！？太好了～！\n看来练习的成果确实展现出来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0454_1005_p", "source_sha256": "1c04dde022759bdfa30d2c29840fc44366b329351584e27d71eaae60530e45b9", "ja": "……あ！\n鏡の前でよく何かしてたけど、もしかして……？", "zh": "……啊！\n你之前经常在镜子前做些什么，难道是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0454_1006_043nor", "source_sha256": "ced5483ffb753b72d3037d2af2cea453b65cf176b6439a22f7db8c7a38c2f2c0", "ja": "うん。……ほら、厳しい家庭教師っていうからには、\nマナーも完璧じゃないとさ。なんか違うかなって。", "zh": "嗯。……你看，既然说是严厉的家庭教师，\n礼仪也要完美才行嘛。不然感觉就不太对劲了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0454_1007_p", "source_sha256": "9058d8b39c2be2d1aef8655e5fac26d929e49fbab81f4e2d450b4ac4d627248e", "ja": "確かに……。教える側の人間がイマイチだったら\nこの物語は成立しないからな……。", "zh": "确实……。教人的那一方如果不够格，\n这个故事就说不通了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0454_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "e7b6de04c091cf05b3db90025a512a92a7d3dba38f1486af0cb969b4b5eebd6d", "ja": "でも練習の成果、出てると思うよ。のり子さんの動きを\n見れば、すごい人なんだってわかるもん。", "zh": "不过，我觉得练习的成果已经展现出来了。只要看看纪子姐的动作，就知道她有多厉害了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0454_1009_043nor", "source_sha256": "7f59995ff518793782c542a2268ce59041b243daed905d9501ee38ef0a7703a2", "ja": "えへへ。桃子に褒めてもらえると、やっぱり嬉しいな。\nアタシが頑張ろうって思えたのは、桃子が理由だし。", "zh": "嘿嘿。能得到桃子的夸奖，果然还是很开心啊。因为桃子，我才觉得自己要努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0454_1010_049mom", "source_sha256": "040f5d0046cdeff9d39a4ee2c272442fa22650796f7b1a63f93572ee16bd4757", "ja": "え、桃子が？", "zh": "诶，桃子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0454_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "9306365ca123052e70494343e5afd8d8202b635c7f6c1044f12c3f3c2f8df54d", "ja": "そうだよ。桃子だって忙しいのに、マナーレッスンや\nダンスレッスンも頑張ってたじゃん？", "zh": "就是啊。桃子明明也很忙，却还努力上礼仪课和舞蹈课了，不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0454_1012_043nor", "source_sha256": "104eabadd44ec7e46508873a86c395210cd7ad1d6b60beae36d7c04bef93cf99", "ja": "あの姿を見てたらさ、役としてだけじゃなくて、アタシ\n個人としても負けてられないな！って思ったんだ。", "zh": "看到桃子那个样子，我就觉得，不只是作为角色，作为我自己也不能输给她！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0454_1013_049mom", "source_sha256": "6debed27bc018fffe9ac11b6a3f0bb73edcda93ccea66f947fbb150b707c0e56", "ja": "……それなら、桃子だって。\nのり子さんと一緒だよ！", "zh": "……要是那样，桃子也是。\n和法子小姐是一样的哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0454_1014_p", "source_sha256": "29c591570dfba6b0dd1db3b0b7943520647f0f6669aec52b72c915f6280579ee", "ja": "桃子？", "zh": "桃子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0454_1015_049mom", "source_sha256": "19ff5ba0fb1a8a23e6d8dd3f70ad46bfa94cb47f220cd338f330372c310b03e4", "ja": "のり子さん、どんな意見もちゃんと受け止めて、\n取り入れて……どんどん演技がうまくなっていくから。", "zh": "因为纪子小姐会认真接受并采纳各种意见……演技也在不断进步，变得越来越好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0454_1016_049mom", "source_sha256": "9f8de10f4d0a6a83cd6b863579db6e42d597e70f18e1240a9ea04fbc8559a92d", "ja": "桃子も、絶対負けられないって\n今回の撮影に挑んでたの。", "zh": "桃子也是抱着绝对不能输的决心，投入到这次拍摄中的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0454_1017_p", "source_sha256": "a5d2ce460f97496782c9cc60f6a13dfab447efe8f0dd3e3fd6e9fa754dc1ded9", "ja": "なるほどな。お互いを意識してたからこそ、\nそれがいい刺激になってたんだな。", "zh": "原来如此。正因为彼此都在意对方，才会成为很好的刺激啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0454_1018_043nor", "source_sha256": "1c3b885f96f385760e217f9cad45ef02b3989e4af1ab13e8579aec183f2f4a0e", "ja": "みたいだね。……アタシ、今回の撮影\n桃子と一緒でよかったなって改めて思ったよ。", "zh": "看来是这样呢……这次能和桃子一起拍摄，我又重新觉得真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0454_1019_043nor", "source_sha256": "80413e4dfd4fa161c466f58268a93100c8d22b6bc68bbcf800b9c78b55929c6e", "ja": "けど、そんな話聞いちゃったらもっと気合いが\n入るよね！　次も桃子をあっと言わせてみせるよ！", "zh": "不过，听到这样的话，干劲就更足了呢！下次我也一定要让桃子大吃一惊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0454_1020_049mom", "source_sha256": "8776092e8c64e6f6b5d930ccda3c8fc56ed4224e081b9279258f952d1106c1f5", "ja": "桃子だって！　完璧なお嬢様に仕上げてくるから、\nのり子さん、びっくりしないでよね！", "zh": "桃子也会！我会把自己打造成完美的大小姐，所以，典子姐可别吓一跳哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0454_1021_p", "source_sha256": "2da4a5e25ecf30d942177ffa62f4859d7ad3fcf9be8636a97f1f37296a71feae", "ja": "（年は離れていても、互いを尊敬しあって高め合う……\nふたりとも、いいコンビだな！）", "zh": "（虽然年纪相差不少，却彼此尊重、共同进步……她们两个真是很棒的组合啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
